n that's not  the only significant development  provided by the nanotech otto octavius  absorbs some of the particles into his  tentacles providing them with a red tint  featured throughout the trailers peter  is able to use this as his advantage and  since he has access to tony stark's tech  he's able to manipulate the tentacles to  do his bidding it ends the fight and  allows him to bring otto into doctor  strange's holding cell when the first  trailers for no way home were released  there was a lot of speculation about  what the black and gold suit would do  was it specifically designed with stand  attacks from electro as it turns out  it's simply peter parker's upgraded suit  turned inside out earlier in the film  with cp to get green paint thrown on him  plenty of new yorkers believe the daily  bugle's propaganda that he's responsible  for mysterio's death with no way to  prove his innocence beatrice puts up  with various assaults including being  dowsed with paint or wearing his  spiderman outfit he doesn't have time to  get it cleaned and always wanting to  look fresh he turns it inside out to  deal with the next interdimensional  threat as it turns out he looks pretty  slick in the new spider threads with the  prominent black fabric and gold accents  shortly after his battle with electro  peter gets the suit cleaned next up this  gold trim suit is one of the most highly  anticipated spidey suits fans have been  waiting to see in action the design was  initially teased as part of a toy league  for no way home and now that the movie's  house audiences can see what the so  called iron spider integration suit is  all about this shiny suit gives peter  the much needed boost in power he needs  to take on all of these previously seen  spider-man villains and surprisingly  it's actually in the movie for quite a  while the suit first makes an appearance  when spidey and friends are at happy  hogan's condo he then takes a suit with  him to the final battle at the statue of  liberty where he stands out compared to  the suits worn by andrew garfield and  toby maguire's spider-man yep garfield  and maguire both turn up and no way home  merry christmas true believers  exel  and finally no way home has what might  just be the most devastating ending of  any mcu film so far before more bad guys  can break into their universe peter  parker has dr strange perform a spell to  make the world forget that peter parker  exists  but still remember that there is a  spider-man as a result mj ned and happy  will lose all of their memories of him  it's a poignant moment and one that  exemplifies what the spider-man persona  is all about his entire philosophy  centers around sacrificing what he truly  wants for the betterment of the world  the last time we see peter he has his  own apartment and is studying for the  ged however he hasn't hung up his  spider-man suit just yet you may no  longer have access to all of tony's gear  but he's pretty proficient with a sewing  machine the last sequence sees him  jumping out of his apartment window  wearing a new homemade suit he designed  we can't show it here but he's stuck  with the red and blue palette from  previous costumes and it looks like  he'll be on his own in any future  franchise installments hey the title  wasn't lying when it said there was no  way home for peter  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  spider-man no way home are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

